<v Speaker 1>Wassalatu Wassalamu Ala Sayyid Alambia Iwil Mursalin, Khatimin Nabiyin, Sayyidin Al-Mumadjad, Bashir Al-Musaddak, Nadir Al-Muayyad, Al-Mustafal Amjad,

5
