<v Speaker 1>Mahmoud al-Ahmad Abul Qasim Muhammad Wa salatu wa salamu ala wa sihi alibnabi Talib ashraf al-wasiyin wa amir al-mumineen Wa salatu wa salamu ala sayed al-imamit tayyib, sahib dawatil nabawiya Wa saulatul Haydariya, wa Ismatul Fatimiya, wa Shujaatul Husayniya, wa Ulum al-Bakariya, wa Ma'akil al-Jasariya

