<v Speaker 1>Allahumma inna na'udubi ka min daawatin la yusta jabulaha wa min mon karatil akhlaq wala amal wala hawa fa'amma ba'ad yaqulu subhanaw wa ta'ala fi kitabahil kareem ba'ada aqula audubillahim mina shaytan rajeem bismillahir rahmanur rahim rabbish rahli sadri wa yasirli amri wahluruqdatamil lesa ni fkahu kawli Allahumma inni a'udubikaan adallah awudal awazila awuzal

8
00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:14.510
<v Speaker 1>Our Aslim, our Uzlam Aliyah.

9
